Accept OBS error 604 from GetVirtualCamStatus (no virtual camera device, e.g. Linux without
v4l2loopback or a box without the macOS camera extension) so `obs_control.py setup/status/vcam`
do not abort. Applies to garycaogan/ai-live-avatar @ 5559ec5440c93814737155183dbe832df0b9f215.

